'''Heart''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 1,000 [[Hearts (Currency)|Hearts]] {{Currency|Heart}} during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is white with a wavy golden and pink stripe on the ridge. The edge is pink, and on the ricasso of the blade is a pink heart engraved in it with a golden border, hence the name. The guard is silver, and the handle is wrapped in white fabric with a golden pommel.
